#. vextrus/takeoff/messages/step1.py (ticket 19a): Step 1's refusals, and two of the seed's Questions (m0-screens 6.7).
msgid "takeoff.step1.discipline_unknown"
msgstr "This page asked about a Discipline Vextrus does not have, so nothing was changed. Reload the page and try again."

msgid "takeoff.step1.no_number"
msgstr "This sheet has no number in its title block"

msgid "takeoff.step1.nothing_chosen"
msgstr "No sheet was chosen, so nothing was changed. Select one or more sheets, then confirm or exclude again."

msgid "takeoff.step1.nothing_to_undo"
msgstr "Nothing of yours to undo on Step 1. Undo takes back only your own Confirmations, exclusions and drawing lists; to change someone else's, exclude the sheet or confirm it back in."

msgid "takeoff.step1.which_kind"
msgstr "What kind of sheet is {number}?"
